    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d465">

                <pb facs="0789" n="779" sameAs="frus:frus1946v10/pg779"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Marshall to
                        Colonel Marshall S. Carter
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-06-29">29 June 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1012. Please deliver the following message to the Chinese Embassy in Washington
                    from Dr. T. V. Soong: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Have instructed Bank of China, New York to pay the War Department, or
                            any agency the Secretary of War should designate, the sum of
                            $4,000,000.00 for our Air Force training program. Please contact the War
                            Department and Mr. T. M. Hsi, Bank of China, New York immediately.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
